    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "Why would you say that I am insane? I wouldn't say that I've lost my mind simply because I've heard the voices and seen the godless things moving in the woods. If anything, I think more clearly now than ever before. I know now that there is such a thing as a living Evil."
      },
